          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是一条较长的 Markdown 回复，包含 `行内代码`、**粗体文字**和足够的内容。回复按钮位于滚动内容底部。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is a longer markdown reply with more than twenty words so the message reader should move the title into the navigation bar and leave the body to start immediately. It keeps enough body text on screen to prove that the reply control belongs to the scroll content instead of being pinned over the bottom edge.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
